<hr>
<p>Using DFS, we explore the neighbors of node 0, starting with node 1. All=
 of its neighbors need to be colored orange, so let=E2=80=99s make a DFS ca=
ll to node 1 to color it orange:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
