mage-13-04-7-XHAANBQC.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>As such, we need to ensure we color all components of the graph by calli=
ng DFS on every uncolored node:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
